<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady.</p>
<p>Trading fairly active. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    57.50-58.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    57.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>	    300-310 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.75-1.00 lower, 450-500 lbs 0.50 higher,</p>
<p>500-650 lbs 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>	    500-600 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>	    600-650 lbs    51.00, few 52.00</p>
</text>
